{"id":"749742933","kind":"answer","title":"高三应该如何将三轮复习的效率最大化？理科？","author":"Thoughts Memo","original_authors":["Thoughts Memo"],"original_source_urls":[],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"AnkiX高考","date":"2019-07-15","updated":"2019-09-14","votes":57,"comment_count":9,"minutes":2,"chars":732,"keywords":["间隔重复","长期记忆","检索练习","Anki","遗忘曲线"],"summary":"要打牢基础，首先得保证大部分学习内容能够记住，也就是需要科学的复习。 说说我自己的经验： 我是高二下开始使用 Anki ，对我的生物、化学、英语都有很大的提升（语文也有，不过高考没考好）。 那 Anki 是什么呢？Anki 是一个基于认知心理学三个学习理论的复习软件。（三个理论分别为： 间隔重复 、 测试效应 、 穿插练习 ）…","question_detail_html":"基础很差的辣种<br/><br/>补充一下，题主现在高二，坐标湖北，分数只能上个本科，想到以后的高三的学习有点方，想提前打算一下<br/><br/><br/>嗯，欢迎回答和补充","zhihu_url":"https://www.zhihu.com/question/270728859/answer/749742933","restoration":null,"toc":[],"html":"<p data-pid=\"bT565Kqw\">要打牢基础，首先得保证大部分学习内容能够记住，也就是需要科学的复习。</p><p data-pid=\"rLvQrW-0\">说说我自己的经验：</p><p data-pid=\"caIGYZUA\">我是高二下开始使用 Anki ，对我的生物、化学、英语都有很大的提升（语文也有，不过高考没考好）。</p><p data-pid=\"LzgHf2MW\">那 Anki 是什么呢？Anki 是一个基于认知心理学三个学习理论的复习软件。（三个理论分别为：<a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"57020308\" href=\"#/post/57020308\">间隔重复</a>、<a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"57113246\" href=\"#/post/57113246\">测试效应</a>、<a class=\"internal\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/57139724\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">穿插练习</a>）</p><p data-pid=\"12m8Zgkd\">这么说有点抽象，我举一个例子：</p><p data-pid=\"E6ClRii5\">比如题主在学如何做化学工业流程，遇到一个题目，问：</p><p data-pid=\"GFQR24Lj\"><b>在xxx步骤中，使用冰水洗涤xxx的目的是什么？</b></p><p data-pid=\"QCORxIHQ\">假设题主不太会，就记了一下，但是一个月内都没有遇到类似的题，自己也没重新去复习，大概率下一次遇到的时候已经忘记了。</p><p data-pid=\"VNAng2SF\">那么用 Anki 可以解决这个问题。</p><p data-pid=\"YG3cR5v6\">首先我们可以用 Anki 制作卡片笔记：</p><p data-pid=\"3CxBAErM\">正面：</p><figure data-size=\"small\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-412fbc6aedbd684ea1d5e7aaa1bb94ee_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-451ff878834bb73f287c1010a1281c2d\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-851c6af2e98ca2bd8310b92d3922cdd4_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"720\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-412fbc6aedbd684ea1d5e7aaa1bb94ee_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-451ff878834bb73f287c1010a1281c2d\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-851c6af2e98ca2bd8310b92d3922cdd4_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"720\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"Ovp6FTNM\">背面：</p><figure data-size=\"small\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-c1ca56ab7d1378f1e2662a612faf273d_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-b305b67b6ede8d1a0eb552c880676d97\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-7e2855d2b9ee5e8b764c3dfa982705a3_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"720\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-c1ca56ab7d1378f1e2662a612faf273d_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-b305b67b6ede8d1a0eb552c880676d97\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-7e2855d2b9ee5e8b764c3dfa982705a3_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"720\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"EJvW5qmJ\">然后 Anki 就会安排复习时间，每次都会先给你看正面，让你回想答案，然后再出现背面，让你为自己的记忆情况评分，然后安排下一次复习，比如：</p><figure data-size=\"small\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-2cfbe1eaccfc0cdfac1a8bb543373ed2_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-2e8de3e0da2a53519483f5e4e0f15cb9\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-63150712c3243b05b14e8c776d71c591_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"720\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-2cfbe1eaccfc0cdfac1a8bb543373ed2_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-2e8de3e0da2a53519483f5e4e0f15cb9\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-63150712c3243b05b14e8c776d71c591_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"720\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"L0yTwUVQ\">这是一张卡片的复习历史记录。每一次你的评分都会改变卡片的难度系数，进而影响下一次复习的时间。</p><p data-pid=\"gOYd7mOd\">Anki 的算法会让你频繁重复生疏内容，而熟悉内容则出现的频率会降低。最终达到 80% - 90% 的内容被你牢牢记住。（如果卡片都是自己做的，甚至可以记住 95% 以上）</p><p data-pid=\"xRAVG8An\">最终，你就能牢牢的掌握你所学的任何内容（前提是你第一遍学会了，并将笔记做在 Anki 上，并严格执行 Anki 安排的复习任务）</p><p data-pid=\"OV8VIolp\">PS：补充一下手机版的截图</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-d9a641a697f7c377f601ead979040ecf_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-b7bc9d68cc3bad4191d13f9c9ee9231d\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-75041fce177cf9f9a3f852ed42847f73_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"634\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-d9a641a697f7c377f601ead979040ecf_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-b7bc9d68cc3bad4191d13f9c9ee9231d\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-75041fce177cf9f9a3f852ed42847f73_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"634\"/></figure><hr/><p data-pid=\"VdyLOtIe\">Anki 支持windows、mac、linux、安卓、苹果等常见设备，并且可以多端同步，走到哪学到哪。</p><p data-pid=\"Pw8bFUZg\">为了帮到有缘人，我写了一份快速上手教程：</p><a class=\"internal\" data-image=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-2e8a109841199b0a18e70ae7bd16ea66_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"535\" data-image-width=\"1220\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/61564332\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">叶峻峣：B 站 Ankidroid 视频教程与电子书(全平台教程)快速通道</a>","rec_chain":[{"id":"57020308","title":"【理论】Study smarter, NOT longer. 你需要间隔重复！","author":"Osmosis from Elsevier","votes":135,"minutes":3,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"57113246","title":"【理论】测试效应——什么？考试有助于我的学习？","author":"Osmosis from Elsevier","votes":105,"minutes":2,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"46855765","title":"使用Anki准备大型考试的设置","author":"Anki","votes":41,"minutes":7,"reason":"延伸深读 · Anki"},{"id":"46533104","title":"疑问:Anki 没有向我展示我的所有卡片！","author":"Anki","votes":12,"minutes":11,"reason":"延伸深读 · Anki"},{"id":"46856037","title":"我要去度假。我可以暂停复习程序吗？","author":"Anki","votes":16,"minutes":2,"reason":"延伸深读 · Anki"},{"id":"38306259","title":"简单常见记忆误区解惑","author":"SuperMemo","votes":29,"minutes":6,"reason":"延伸深读 · SuperMemo"},{"id":"6046109771","title":"如何追赶积压的 Anki 复习任务","author":"Soren Bjornstad","votes":209,"minutes":14,"reason":"延伸深读 · Soren Bjornstad"}],"rec_answers":[{"id":"1005545481","title":"有哪些实用学习的APP可以推荐一下？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":66,"minutes":1,"reason":"相似问答 · 66 赞同"},{"id":"1110965751","title":"高中一天学的知识点很多，从头到尾回忆复习一遍所需时间太长，没时间，怎么办？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":14,"minutes":2,"reason":"相似问答 · 14 赞同"},{"id":"1024915739","title":"有没有什么好用的手机学习软件？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":17,"minutes":1,"reason":"相似问答 · 17 赞同"},{"id":"1882739659","title":"Anki 怎么用高效？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":241,"minutes":2,"reason":"相似问答 · 241 赞同"},{"id":"773275384","title":"有什么好的学习方法能让高三一年提高二百多分？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":28,"minutes":1,"reason":"相似问答 · 28 赞同"}]}